    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't think i want to just \"be.\" everything about being feels like a chore now. i've done everything i was \"supposed\" to do, and it led to a dead end. it's like i've completed the mission and now there's no reason to stay in the game. does that even make sense? like, if there's nothing left to achieve, why keep going through the motions?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
